**SECTION B: FIELD WORK AND TECHNIQUES**

2. Based on fieldwork you have undertaken in Physical or Human Geography, choose one of the following topics:

i) Variation in any ONE soil characteristic;

ii) Differences in any weather element;

iii) Changes in any ONE vegetation characteristic;

iv) Differences in rural or urban land uses or characteristic;

v) Location of a modern farm or agricultural system;

vi) Changes or the relative importance of any ONE industrial or factory characteristic.
